target: skills/review/review-loop/review-stats.py
verify: cd skills/review/review-loop && ./review-stats.test.sh
expect: a waived gate is declined, not reported as a failure
why:    a waiver passes the gate (references/measurement-gate.md:65), so reporting it as a failure to complete is the third occurrence of this one decision going wrong — not a wrong side this time, but a word the prose already documents left off the allowlist
--- old
DECLINED_STATES = ("skipped", "pending", "deferred", "waived")
--- new
DECLINED_STATES = ("skipped", "pending", "deferred")
